From c498007d4881da4ee236edbab782f893227cd8a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 08:34:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] perf(fonts): subset comic fonts to woff2 (15.4MB ->
 1.6MB)

Comic theme fonts were full TTF files: 15.4MB total, downloaded whenever
the comic style is active. Subset each font to the character set used by
UI locale text + ASCII + 3500 most-frequent CJK chars (jieba freq) and
convert to woff2: 1.6MB total (-90%). Gaegu-Bold.ttf was corrupt in the
repo (truncated table) - replaced from google/fonts upstream.
